    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daef62dac1985e0931ebfa67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看向艾尼斯风神注视的方向，\n一个赛马娘端着放了大量甜点的托盘\n东张西望地前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b4b4bd01ec40fdbf6ee14296e0477b0ba2ee9b7b02eb800fedf057fe2d67f6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
